{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 885, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0acf0b8f7d12f2ff14ffaa4f49df26af8b2f36cf9a9fa99f16ff0f3f18d81432f2ff273f274f0af8148", "baseline_text": "레니…//기체 손상이 심한 것 같은데，//괜찮아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "レニ……//機体の損傷がひどいようだけど、//大丈夫かい？", "pointer_offset": 760, "unit": "dialogue:49ef8afd89397e0b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 940, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f266f98ef0adf7d1f0affb74f1bdf9c6f94af154f15a81442f2ff15af947f2aaf240f94bf2658144", "baseline_text": "걱정 마…아직 싸울 수 있어．//어서 명령해 줘．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "心配ない……まだ戦える。//はやく命令を。", "pointer_offset": 764, "unit": "dialogue:c09c7bb5496c25a0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 981, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f2aa8143f2aaf240f0d3f144f7d1", "baseline_text": "명，명령인가…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "め、命令か……", "pointer_offset": 768, "unit": "dialogue:424150b417c33c35", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 2138, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af8143f1edf164f0b2f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "좋아，공격이다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし、攻撃だ！", "pointer_offset": 772, "unit": "dialogue:0c0c5da3339ad6cb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1011, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af8143f16af1a8f0a5f0fa8144", "baseline_text": "좋아，회복하자．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし、回復するんだ。", "pointer_offset": 776, "unit": "dialogue:7cb6ce36e13bbfc9", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 2155, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af8143f1edf164f0b2f0cf81b82f2f8175f1edf164f8b2f26ef1d1f8e1f1c5f15a8176f0a8f184f0f42f2ff0a5f0b8fa61f263f0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "좋아，공격이다∈//「공격이 최선의 방어」라고도//하니까 말이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし、攻撃だ！//「攻撃は最大の防御」とも//言うしね。", "pointer_offset": 780, "unit": "dialogue:bbf793931f66f5c0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1085, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f7d1f2c9f29ef15a81442f2ff0ecf8c8f164f174f257f0f18144", "baseline_text": "…알겠어．//적을 격파할게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……了解。//敵を撃破する。", "pointer_offset": 784, "unit": "dialogue:34f2173a9d56cea7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1112, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0b5f3ee81b82f2ff0acf0b8f944f2ddf0a5f0cff984f14bf14781432f2ff1edf164f9d4f0bcf167f9c7f991f26781b8", "baseline_text": "오빠∈//레니가 강하다고 해서，//공격만 시키면 안 돼∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お兄ちゃん∈//レニが強いからって、//こーげきばかりさせちゃダメ！", "pointer_offset": 788, "unit": "dialogue:eafef54c4e0771c5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1177, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0a2f2b381ac2f2ff0af8143f0aff0b2f0aef0aa8148", "baseline_text": "으앗〓//아，아이리스？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いいっ〓//ア、アイリス？", "pointer_offset": 792, "unit": "dialogue:d43ea7c390080159", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1202, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0f1f0cff144f7d1f0acf0b8f8f4f263f0b2f14881b82f2ff16bf0aef9d4f27bf15cf0a5f1c781432f2ff77cfd4af991f94bfa85f1c8f0b8f26181b8", "baseline_text": "게다가…레니도 말이야∈//무리만 계속하면，//샴푸 안 해 줄 거니까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それに……レニもだよ！//ムチャばっかりしてたら、//シャンプーしてあげないからね∈", "pointer_offset": 796, "unit": "dialogue:d3fc6b2ad5b044bf", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1283, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0a28143f3a8f7d1f2c9f2e9f15a81442f2ff0b2f8dff16bf0aef0a5f8a4f287f0c8f0f18144", "baseline_text": "으，응…알았어．//이제 무리하지 않을게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "う、うん……わかった。//もう無茶はしないよ。", "pointer_offset": 800, "unit": "dialogue:86fd6454b49a19fb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1328, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f0cff9c7f25df15a81b82f2ff9bcf0cf81432f2ff0dff0e2f8a3f16af1a8f14bf948f14b81b8", "baseline_text": "알았다면 됐어∈//둘 다，//제대로 회복해야 해∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わかればよろしい！//ふたりとも、//ちゃんと回復するんだよ∈", "pointer_offset": 804, "unit": "dialogue:6c20ad3b402587a9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1387, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f2cef1adf7d1fa81f1f9f0a5f29ef0f081442f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf0b9f0f1f957fa81f1f9f1a9f0cff0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "후우…못 당하겠네．//아이리스에게는 못 당한다니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふぅ……まいったな。//アイリスにはかなわないよ。", "pointer_offset": 808, "unit": "dialogue:26163d66a3800ef4", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1436, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff25af96bf16bf0aef0a5f0a4f1572f2ff0ad8144", "baseline_text": "하지만…//너무 무리하지는//마．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも……//あまり、無理は//するんじゃないぞ。", "pointer_offset": 812, "unit": "dialogue:4e1f5f83d922b3a6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 2216, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f8b1f0faf0dbf8b9f0e2f14bf147f15781432f2ff19cf944f144f8e4fa80f2c9f984f154f15a8144", "baseline_text": "나 자신에 대해서는，//내가 가장 잘 알고 있어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "自分のことは、//自分が一番知っている。", "pointer_offset": 816, "unit": "dialogue:c6456f0b38481453", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 2257, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0affb74f1bdf9c6f94af154f15af7d12f2ff266f18efa57f473f8eff1b5f15a8144", "baseline_text": "아직 싸울 수 있어…//걱정할 필요 없어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まだ戦える……//心配はいらない。", "pointer_offset": 820, "unit": "dialogue:f4da15637003ca6c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1553, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef168f0b1f7d12f2ff1cff0af8143f0c1f0cf81b82f2ff1edf964f182f1aa8143f8ecf0adf14ef14ff15081b8", "baseline_text": "그렇구나…//좋아，간다∈//공격 목표，적 마조기병∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうか……//よし、いくぞ！//攻撃目標、敵魔操機兵！", "pointer_offset": 824, "unit": "dialogue:a9c045996d52f717", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 2292, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "f2c9f29ef15a81b8", "baseline_text": "알겠어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解！", "pointer_offset": 828, "unit": "dialogue:db0a8b18246bc9c0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1611, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af8143f16af1a8f0a5f0fa81442f2ff16ef0a3f957f459f957f299f8f4f140f0eff14b8144", "baseline_text": "좋아，회복하자．//때로는 쉬는 것도 중요해．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし、回復するんだ。//時には休むことも大切だよ。", "pointer_offset": 832, "unit": "dialogue:d589352ee91385c3", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1660, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f7d1f184f0adf1c98143f0e2f0e481442f2ff0a5f0a4f1d48143f99cf1a9f27bf157f7d12f2ff19cf944f144f8e4fa80f2c9f984f154f15a8144", "baseline_text": "…고마워，대장．//하지만，내 한계는…//내가 가장 잘 알고 있어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……ありがとう、隊長。//でも、ボクの限界は……//ボク自身が一番知っている。", "pointer_offset": 836, "unit": "dialogue:6edba19407036e82", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1735, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f347f8b2fa98f18ef0f4f0a32f2ff16bf0aef0a5f0a4f957f287f8c8f2aff0b8f261f7d12f2ff191f36cf14b8144", "baseline_text": "짐이 될 정도로//무리하지는 않을 테니까…//안심해．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "足手まといになるような//無茶はしないから……//安心して。", "pointer_offset": 840, "unit": "dialogue:bc23661a53d7a8b5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1792, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef168f0b1f7d12f2ff0a5f0a4f1d48143f16bf0aef0a5f0a4f957f0ad8144", "baseline_text": "그렇구나…//하지만，무리하지는 마．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうか……//でも、無理はするんじゃないぞ。", "pointer_offset": 844, "unit": "dialogue:308242e176f238d1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1835, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f3a88143f2c9f2e9f15a81442f2ff0e2f0e4f7d1f266f18ef94bf265f14781432f2ff184f0adf1c98144", "baseline_text": "응，알았어．//대장…걱정해 줘서，//고마워．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん、わかった。//隊長……心配してくれて、//ありがとう。", "pointer_offset": 848, "unit": "dialogue:37257449e9b27ae0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1892, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "8163816381638163", "baseline_text": "…………", "kind": "ascr", "source": "…………", "pointer_offset": 852, "unit": "dialogue:b5999fb8c439aedc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1901, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0e2f0e481442f2ff2f9f165f8f3f1a9f2e7f0c1f8b9f19cf0aef8a4f287f0a2f1c781432f2ff64cf35ff0a5f8f1fa98f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "…대장．//판단은 한순간에 내리지 않으면，//패배하게 될 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……隊長。//判断は一瞬でしないと、//敗北することになるよ。", "pointer_offset": 856, "unit": "dialogue:9da0e6c07b150e17", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 1960, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0ab8143f0abf191f14bf7d12f2ff0c6f0f7f8b2f18ef0aef243f8a4f287f0aff147f7d1", "baseline_text": "미，미안해…//생각이 정리되지 않아서…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "す、すまない……//考えがまとまらなくて……", "pointer_offset": 860, "unit": "dialogue:9d826c82dc0b598c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 2305, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f8b1f0faf0dbf8b9f0e2f14bf147f15781432f2ff19cf944f144f8e4fa80f2c9f984f154f15a8144", "baseline_text": "나 자신에 대해서는，//내가 가장 잘 알고 있어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "自分のことは、//自分が一番知っている。", "pointer_offset": 864, "unit": "dialogue:c6456f0b38481453", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 2042, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0affb74f1bdf9c6f94af154f15af7d12f2ff266f98ef0ad8144", "baseline_text": "아직 싸울 수 있어…//걱정 마．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まだ戦える……//心配はいらない。", "pointer_offset": 868, "unit": "dialogue:f4da15637003ca6c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 2075, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef168f0b1f7d12f2ff1cff0af8143f0c1f0cf81b82f2ff1edf964f182f1aa8143f8ecf0adf14ef14ff15081b8", "baseline_text": "그렇구나…//좋아，간다∈//공격 목표，적 마조기병∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうか……//よし、いくぞ！//攻撃目標、敵魔操機兵！", "pointer_offset": 872, "unit": "dialogue:a9c045996d52f717", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 2346, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "f2c9f29ef15a81b8", "baseline_text": "알겠어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解！", "pointer_offset": 876, "unit": "dialogue:05bca2e89795ea2d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02016.SBN", "offset": 2133, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 880, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
